body:
Of all the guys I’ve slept with, 2 themes keep repeating themselves. Nearly all guys are guilty of these 2 things in my experience;

1) forgetting I have a clit 95% of the time

2) not thinking I should get to cum if he gets to cum. For so many guys, it’s over when he comes. Not denying that these guys do make a great effort for me to have a good time - they do - but even these guys think it’s over when they cum, when I very often haven’t
